**Workaround.** Disable `checksVoidReturn.arguments` for `no-misused-promises`, and disable `strict-void-return` if it is enabled, for the affected files. An `eslint-disable` comment does not help, since the cost is incurred by rule execution even when any rule violation is ignored.

